    <briefdescription>
<para>Custom deleter for <ref refid="classcslt_1_1Heap" kindref="compound">Heap</ref> instances, for use with <ref refid="classcslt_1_1UniquePtr" kindref="compound">UniquePtr</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Calls the <ref refid="classcslt_1_1Heap" kindref="compound">Heap</ref> destructor (which in turn calls <ref refid="classcslt_1_1ArrayDeleter" kindref="compound">ArrayDeleter</ref> on the backing array, destroying all elements and freeing the buffer) then returns the <ref refid="classcslt_1_1Heap" kindref="compound">Heap</ref> struct memory to the allocator.</para>
